  "question": {
    "text": "In&nbsp;a new system of units, the unit of force is <math> <mrow> <mtext>100&nbsp;N</mtext></mrow></math>, unit of length is <math> <mrow> <mtext>10&nbsp;m</mtext></mrow> </math> and unit of time is <math> <mrow> <mtext>100&nbsp;s</mtext></mrow></math>. Unit of mass in this system can be expressed as",
    "image": null
  },
